    "innovation": "Using a coupled climate model, this paper shows that gradual changes in atmospheric CO\u2082 can trigger abrupt shifts in the Atlantic Meridional Overturning Circulation under glacial conditions by altering atmospheric moisture transport across Central America, which modulates the North Atlantic's freshwater budget and deep-water formation.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
